-<html>
-<head>
-  <title>HTML 4.01/CSS 2.1 Test: white-space (for complex text)</title>
-  <link rel="help" href="http://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/text.html#white-space-prop" title="16.6 Whitespace: the 'white-space' property">
-</head>
-<body>
